<title>USA: Brown Group increases size of board to 12.</title>
<headline>Brown Group increases size of board to 12.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brown Group Inc said Thursday it elected Thomas Williams as a director, increasing the size of its board to 12 members.</p>
<p>Williams has served as a vice president of the company and president of Brown Shoe Co, a member of Brown Group, since 1994.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
